L1_1.mode = "text"
L1_1.title = "The Words of the First"
L1_1.author = "Unknown Author"
L1_1.text = "Do not fear Decay. Fear what remains still while everything else changes. We have spent too long trying to preserve a world that no longer exists. The sea does not rise to destroy us. It rises because the world is moving, and we are moving with it. I have seen men waste away trying to remain what they once were. I have seen others accept what they were becoming. Now I understand that survival does not mean preserving one's form. I have seen what lies beyond the boundary. I have reached the place where boats are shattered and where even the Keepers are afraid to look. I did not find death. I found transformation. If one day I cross that boundary again and do not return, do not search for my body. Do not search for a monster to blame. Instead, search within yourselves for that voice that keeps telling you that to change is to die. Perhaps that is the true prison. Perhaps Decay is not the end of mankind. Perhaps it is only the end of mankind as we knew it."
